          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Wing Over is an arcade flight sim released for the PS1 in 1997. Featuring system link support for multi-player and a full single player tournament system, as well as a large roster of characters and planes to choose from, Wing Over has earned the title of a cult classic on the PS1.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Wing Over es un simulador de vuelo arcade lanzado para PS1 en 1997. Con soporte de conexión en red para multijugador y un completo sistema de torneos para un jugador, además de un amplio plantel de personajes y aviones para elegir, Wing Over se ha ganado el título de clásico de culto en PS1.",
